description=Universal camera & lens switch fix for garnet (Poco X6 5G / Redmi Note 13 Pro 5G): native Photo/Video SAT lens switching, smooth 0.6x-5x zoom, reduced oversharpening & temporal smearing, active 0.6x UltraWide LDC, boosted H.264/HEVC video bitrates, and FHD60 with auto UW 30fps clamp.
